  desc 'rationale', <<~RATIONALE
    Port 20 is FTP's data channel. Opened to the world it completes the
    exposure port 21 begins — the control channel authenticates, the data
    channel moves the bytes — and it is the half that gets left open,
    because an operator closing FTP usually thinks only of 21. Like every
    network ACL entry it applies to the whole subnet and is evaluated
    statelessly.
  RATIONALE

